# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NavAlert — repository ignore rules
#
# Android-specific build clutter (/.gradle, /captures, .cxx/, local.properties,
# the Gradle wrapper, GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java) lives in android/.gitignore,
# which is the stock Flutter template and is deliberately left as-is. The Gradle
# wrapper is absent on purpose: `flutter build` re-injects it from the SDK
# (injectGradleWrapperIfNeeded), so a clean clone still builds.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Flutter / Dart / Pub ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/build/
.dart_tool/
.pub-cache/
.pub/
.packages
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
lib/generated_plugin_registrant.dart
pubspec_overrides.yaml
coverage/
.fvm/

# Desktop-embedder scaffolding, regenerated by the tool.
**/ephemeral/

# ── Android ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mirrors of android/.gitignore, in case these ever appear at the repo root.
.gradle/
.cxx/
captures/
local.properties
.kotlin/

# Signed output and signing material. NEVER commit a keystore.
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
key.properties

# ── IDEs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user

# ── OS metadata ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Logs and scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp

# Claude Code: machine-local session state. The lock file holds a PID and a
# session id, so it is meaningless to anyone else and changes constantly.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Legacy .NET prototype ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NavAlert was rewritten from a C#/.NET MAUI prototype; these guard against
# stray artifacts if that tree is ever restored alongside.
bin/
obj/

# ── Local workspace scratch, not part of the shipped app ─────────────────────
DoThistxt
AutomationTools/
repair_build.ps1

# ── Chapter 3 GUI mockups (~15 MB of PNGs) ───────────────────────────────────
# Design reference the UI was built against, kept locally but deliberately NOT
# pushed — artwork, not source, and it would bloat every clone. The screens they
# specify are documented per-file in the `UI/UX MAP` headers in lib/views/.
GUI NavAlert/

# Python bytecode from the tooling in tool/ and .claude/skills/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
